<!--
    Alpha-only notification small icon (a bell, matching the in-app
    NotificationsActive icon used for the "check reminders now" button).

    Android notification small icons ignore fillColor entirely and render
    ONLY the alpha/silhouette shape, in white
    (https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/build-notification#SmallIcon).
    The previous placeholder, android.R.drawable.ic_dialog_info, is a
    filled solid circle -> its silhouette is just a solid disc, which is
    why it showed up as a blank/illegible blob instead of a bell. This is
    a proper outline-style vector so the silhouette itself is legible.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="24dp"
    android:height="24dp"
    android:viewportWidth="24"
    android:viewportHeight="24">
